A chase begins because of course it does.

Nebula escapes in a stolen Apollo lander.

Cage pursues in the Crown Victoria.

Jessica:

“THAT CAR CANNOT FLY.”

Cage:

“Not with that attitude.”

He hits a red button labeled:

PURSUIT MODE

Nothing happens.

Cage hits it again.

Still nothing.

Little Nick:

“Try starting it.”

Cage turns key.

Engine starts.

Car lifts off.

Jessica:

“WHY DOES THAT WORK?”

Cage:

“AMERICAN ENGINEERING.”

The Crown Vic flies directly into a satellite.

Entire dashboard lights up.

Cage:

“Cosmetic.”

Then dispatch calls.

“Unit 7, pursuit unauthorized.”

Cage:

“Copy.”

He hangs up.

Jessica:

“You’re ignoring them?”

“No.”

“What are you doing?”

“Interpreting aggressively.”

