Final scene.

Nebula is in moon jail.

Cage is doing paperwork.

Jessica:

“So that’s it?”

Cage:

“For tonight.”

Outside the station window, something enormous passes in front of Earth.

A shadow.

Too big.

Little Nick slowly stands.

“Boss?”

Cage looks up.

A giant spaceship appears.

On the side:

UNIT 3

Cage whispers:

“…I thought Unit 3 was dead.”

Jessica:

“You knew there was a Unit 3?”

“No.”

“Then why did you say that?”

Cage stands.

A hatch opens in the spaceship.

A figure steps out.

Twelve feet tall.

Space helmet.

Tan trench coat.

Big Nick.

But older.

Scar over one eye.

He lands.

BOOM.

Regular Cage:

“Big Nick?”

Big Nick removes helmet.

“NOT ANYMORE.”

Long pause.

“My name is…”

He puts on aviators.

“BIGGER NICK.”

Little Nick:

“Oh, fuck off.”

